      en: ["Named in honor of Sir William Murphy, who championed local land ownership.", "Settled alongside Dundas Town as a result of the 1930s land allotment acts.", "Occupies some of the highest residential land in central Abaco.", "A primary residential source for the Marsh Harbour service economy.", "Famous for its community spirit and annual Junkanoo celebrations.", "Serves as a key location for the island's postal and administrative services."],
