      hu: ["Old Bight ad otthont a Father Jerome által épített Szent Júdás-templomnak.", "A település Cat Island déli harmadában helyezkedik el.", "A közelben találhatók a történelmi DeVaux-ültetvény romjai.", "Az Armbrister Creek fontos mangrove-ökoszisztéma a területen.", "A helyi lakosság főleg paradicsom- és ananásztermesztéssel foglalkozik.", "A falu strandjai híresek érintetlen fehér és rózsaszín homokjukról."],
      ro: ["Old Bight găzduiește Biserica Sf. Iuda, proiectată de preotul Jerome.", "Localitatea este situată în treimea sudică a insulei Cat Island.", "Ruinele plantației DeVaux sunt situate la mică distanță de așezare.", "Pârâul Armbrister Creek oferă un habitat natural pentru numeroase specii marine.", "Agricultura de subzistență este principala sursă de venit a localnicilor.", "Plajele din Old Bight sunt printre cele mai puțin populate din Bahamas."],
      en: ["Old Bight is home to the landmark St. Jude’s Anglican Church.", "It is located in the southern part of Cat Island.", "The ruins of the 18th-century DeVaux Mansion are located nearby.", "Armbrister Creek is a major local waterway used for kayaking.", "The community is a center for traditional Bahamian farming techniques.", "The settlement is known for its extensive and pristine beachfronts."],
